    <mxCell id="m17" value="17. Multipart S3 upload (track + flight-record)" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;strokeColor=#059669;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11.5;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0F172A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;labelBorderColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1385" y="958" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="1595" y="958" as="targetPoint" /><mxPoint x="0" y="-12" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
