    <mxCell id="m21" value="21. EB Pipe -&gt; SQS (verif)" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;strokeColor=#E7157B;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11.5;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0F172A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;labelBorderColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1595" y="1146" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="1800" y="1146" as="targetPoint" /><mxPoint x="0" y="-12" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="m22" value="22. Bedrock can_close -&gt; case &amp; order closed" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;strokeColor=#01A88D;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11.5;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0F172A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;labelBorderColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1800" y="1184" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="755" y="1184" as="targetPoint" /><mxPoint x="0" y="-12" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="m23" value="23. Return plot to Area Mode" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;strokeColor=#16A34A;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11.5;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0F172A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;align=left;fontFamily=Helvetica;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="755" y="1200" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="755" y="1228" as="targetPoint" /><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="797" y="1200" /><mxPoint x="797" y="1228" /></Array><mxPoint x="10" y="0" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="legend_bg" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1332" width="1840" height="140" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="legend_title" value="Legend &amp; Invariants" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="54" y="1338" width="1812" height="22" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="legend_text" value="1. Human authorization invariant (ADR-002): only a Federation agronomist (MFA &lt;= 10 min) authorizes; authorizer != pilot; no trigger ever authorizes.&lt;br/&gt;2. Offline resilience: mission package preloaded before takeoff (VLAN 102 or municipal seat); encrypted buffer holds record/photos until link returns.&lt;br/&gt;3. Closure invariant: without persisted verification photos/track, case stays open (verifying) and alarms fire; dose/mixture/flight plan are out of scope.&lt;br/&gt;4. S3 hierarchy (KMS objects, 5y retention): farms/{farm_id}/cases|campaigns/.../{mission_id}/; ungranted or person_present objects quarantined/restricted.&lt;br/&gt;5. Dashed lines = offline flight/buffering or async response; solid lines = live API, MQTT, S3 upload, or state transition." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#334155;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="54" y="1360" width="1812" height="108" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
  </root>
</mxGraphModel>
